  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Climate Resilient Forest and Landscape Rehabilitation Programme (CRFLRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest conservation and restoration is implemented over 13,000 ha of degraded lands in selected watersheds&#x25A3; &#xC0B0;&#xB9BC;&#x2D1;&#xD1A0;&#xC9C0; 13,000 &#xD5E5;&#xD0C0;&#xB974; &#xBCF5;&#xC6D0; &#xBC0F; &#xAE30;&#xC220;&#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;
&#x25A3; &#xC0B0;&#xB9BC;&#x2D1;&#xD1A0;&#xC9C0; &#xBCF5;&#xC6D0; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0; &#xC7AC;&#xC6D0; &#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xAC15;&#xD654;
&#x25A3; &#xC0B0;&#xB9BC;&#x2D1;&#xD1A0;&#xC9C0; &#xBCF5;&#xAD6C;&#xB97C; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xAD6D;&#xC81C;&#xD611;&#xB825; &#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xB9C8;&#xB828;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support Ethiopia&apos;s climate change response and green economy strategy (climate resilient green economy), a system for implementing a land use plan for the project target basin is to be formed, and support for forest restoration in local communities. Activities include sharing best practices for forest restoration as needed, strengthening the capacity of implementing ministries, and conducting campaigns to improve local land use awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
